/**
 * @defgroup RoModular_Repositories_CPSTL CPSTL
 * @ingroup RoModular_Repositories
 * @brief Portable C++ standard-library vocabulary for hosted and freestanding targets.
 *
 * | Field | Value |
 * | ----- | ----- |
 * | Role | Bottom layer: `cpstd` containers, algorithms, traits and utilities |
 * | Current release | [`v1.1.5`](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/CPSTL/releases/tag/v1.1.5) |
 * | Source | [ChecheRomo96/CPSTL](https://github.com/ChecheRomo96/CPSTL) |
 * | Documentation | [CPSTL on GitHub Pages](https://checheromo96.github.io/CPSTL/) |
 * | Public CMake target | `CPSTL::CPSTL` |
 *
 * CPSTL is Foundation's portable standard vocabulary. It has no RoModular
 * library dependency and supports both zero-cost aliases to `std` and its own
 * freestanding C++11 implementation for targets such as AVR.
 */
